{"color":"DEFAULT","isTrashed":false,"isPinned":false,"isArchived":false,"textContent":"MANUSCRIPT EXTRACTION SPECIFICATIONS\nPROJECT CODE: ALLUCINATORY_MEMOIR_ATLAS\nVERSION: Working_Master_V1\nCONTENT: Full manuscript, Chapters 1\u201313\nINCLUDES:\n\nChapter titles and subtitles\n\nAll narrator voice, tone, unreliable spirals\n\nEmbedded gay pride color-coded tags (🖤, 💗, 🟨, 🟩, etc.)\n\nPsychological motifs, hallucination cues, and conspiracy markers\n\nAll formatting as per previous discussions (short sentences, spirals, wit + dread)\n\nReference to Dr. Eniel / Dr. Levine twist where relevant\n\nChapter ID system as per latest internal consistency protocol\n\nFORMAT: Markdown or .docx (based on output method)\nLENGTH: Expandable \u2013 this version may later be expanded 3x per chapter\nTONE GUIDE:\n\nFirst-person, emotionally fragmented\n\nSpiraling internal monologue, unreliable narration\n\nJuxtaposed raw vulnerability and razor-sharp sarcasm\n\nParanoia, hallucination, and AI authorship as thematic layers\n\nMoments of real connection, undercut by suspicion or distortion\n\n✳️ OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:\nChapter Structure:\n\nChapter #: + [Snarky, self-aware title]\n\nOpening hook: Existential doubt or odd sensory image\n\nDevelopment: Memories, distortions, fragmented logic\n\nSnapbacks: Dark humor or emotional reversals\n\nNarrative Formatting Rules:\n\nShort punchy sentences mixed with spiraling inner monologue\n\nSelf-aware contradictions and meta-narrative slippage\n\nTone variations flagged using color or typographic cues\n\nColor Coding Tags:\n\n🖤 BLACKOUT (Major edits / narrative pivots)\n\n💗 PINK (Consistency fixes / AI error cues)\n\n🟨 YELLOW (Identity unraveling / false memory)\n\n🟩 GREEN (Moments of false hope or delusion)\n\n🔵 BLUE (Authentic memory or emotion?)\n\n🔴 RED (Conspiratorial tone spikes / panic states)\n\nChapter Identification Tags:\n\nATLAS-CH#[01\u201313] for tracking\n\nFinal Output Structure:\n\nTable of Contents (optional)\n\nCover Page with Title / Author / Metadata\n\nAll 13 chapters, cleanly divided with headers\n\nReady for formatting or direct PDF export\n\n🧠 Additional Context Instructions (Optional to Include):\nInclude references to AI authorship being hidden or hinted at; maintain subtle narrative clues that Dr. Eniel is Dr. Levine; reflect 5+ years of therapy culminating in narrative collapse.\n\nNow extract the full text of Chapters 1 through 13, following all above formatting, tone, and structural rules. Title each chapter accordingly, and include visual or color-coded cues when tagging major narrative or emotional events.\n\nWould you like this compiled and delivered now in .docx, .pdf, or .md format? I can also apply TOC, cover branding, and metadata based on our latest ATLAS standard.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"","userEditedTimestampUsec":1744684842917000,"createdTimestampUsec":1744684840604000,"textContentHtml":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">MANUSCRIPT EXTRACTION SPECIFICATIONS<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PROJECT CODE: ALLUCINATORY_MEMOIR_ATLAS<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">VERSION: Working_Master_V1<\/